          <span class="std-badge">MN 7.3.1.1</span>
        </div>
        <div class="slide-body">
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Direct Citation:</strong> Pulling verbatim excerpts from text to back up your claims.</li>
            <li><strong>Citation Formatting:</strong> Always enclose exact words in quotation marks and cite the author or slide source.</li>
            <li><strong>No Naked Quotes:</strong> Never drop a quote into your response without introducing it or explaining its significance.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="callout-box">
