            <li><strong>Example Word:</strong> <em>Deconstruction</em></li>
            <li><strong>Prefix:</strong> <em>de-</em> (down, away from)</li>
            <li><strong>Root:</strong> <em>struct</em> (to build)</li>
            <li><strong>Suffix:</strong> <em>-tion</em> (state or process of)</li>
            <li><strong>Synthesized Meaning:</strong> The process of breaking down a built structure into its component parts.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="callout-box">
