          <ul>
            <li><strong>Diction:</strong> The deliberate choice of words made by an author or speaker.</li>
            <li><strong>Denotation:</strong> The explicit, dictionary definition of a word.</li>
            <li><strong>Connotation:</strong> The emotional or cultural associations attached to a word (e.g., <em>frugal</em> vs. <em>cheap</em>).</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="callout-box">
